{"id":786591,"title":"30｜AutoGen基本使用介绍","content":"O2GEN Studio是一个用于构建和测试智能代理的平台，主要由Build、Playground和Gallery三个菜单组成。Build菜单下有Skill、模型、agents及workflow四个子项。Skill指的是如发送邮件、生成图像等基于Python方法或外部API的功能。模型部分允许接入开源或商业的大语言模型，包括GPT-4、GPT-3.5等，并支持本地部署的国内大模型。Agents即代理，可以创建具有特定技能的角色，系统默认提供用户代理与primary assistant两种类型。用户代理负责执行代码并反馈错误信息给primary assistant，后者根据任务需求规划步骤并通过生成代码解决问题，两者间存在频繁交互直至任务完成。Primary assistant绑定具体模型（如GPT-4-1106）并配置相应技能以实现更复杂的任务处理。Workflow定义了特定场景下的多agent协作流程。通过Playground可验证上述配置的有效性。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":397490,"user_name":"Geek_50ffc9","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4071935,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"933F4BB7686219","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1738742631,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":2,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"2025-02-05新部署的autostudio版本，改动挺大，找不到新增model和技能的地方了","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1211991,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/7e/57/8c1051b6.jpg","nickname":"3.0的A7","note":"","ucode":"23C5F02B45CE39","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":657788,"discussion_content":"是不是在gallery中呀，里边有tools models","content_length":29,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1740664134,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":1211991,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/7e/57/8c1051b6.jpg","nickname":"3.0的A7","note":"","ucode":"23C5F02B45CE39","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":657787,"discussion_content":"没错呀，老师也不回复"